andidates\u202fC and\u202fD would help refine the choice.\n**What would change my vote:** If another agent can provide evidence that either C or D possesses strong, demonstrable teamwork and communication abilities that outweigh their listed negatives, or if B\u2019s pretentiousness is shown to cause serious crew friction, I would reconsider and possibly shift to the candidate with the best overall balance of reliability, technical competence, and crew cooperation.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
